#!golden 1
#!case chassis_policy_help
#!section exit
1
#!section stdout
#!section stderr
chassis policy <state>
   list        : return supported policies
   always-on   : turn on when power is restored
   previous    : return to previous state when power is restored
   always-off  : stay off after power is restored
#!section requests
> netfn=0x2c lun=0x00 cmd=0x00 target_cmd=0x00 data=00
< rule=default ccode=0xc1 len=0 data=
> netfn=0x2c lun=0x00 cmd=0x00 target_cmd=0x00 data=03
< rule=default ccode=0xc1 len=0 data=
bye
